# @knittotextile/knitto-rabbitmq

## Sumber kebenaran API

**WAJIB baca** sebelum publish/subscribe:

- `node_modules/@knittotextile/knitto-rabbitmq/README.md`
- Repo: https://github.com/knittotextile/knitto-rabbitmq

Jangan duplikasi API di rule ini. `init`, `publishMessage`, `subscribe`, `createConsumer` — ada di README.

## Entry point proyek ini

| File | Peran |
|------|-------|
| [`src/libs/config/rabbitConnection.ts`](src/libs/config/rabbitConnection.ts) | Singleton — import dari sini |
| [`src/index.ts`](src/index.ts) | `await rabbitConnection.init()` sebelum app start |
| [`src/app/messageBroker/index.ts`](src/app/messageBroker/index.ts) | `subscribe()` ke `./consumers` |
| `src/app/messageBroker/publishers/` | `publishMessage` |
| `src/app/messageBroker/consumers/<domain>/` | `*.consumer.ts`, `*.handler.ts`, `*.request.ts` |

Env: `rabbitMQConfig` di [`src/libs/config`](src/libs/config).

## Konvensi proyek (tidak ada di README package)

Arsitektur consumer: [`boilerplate.mdc`](boilerplate.mdc). Playbook + snippet: skill [`knitto-rabbitmq-consumer`](../skills/knitto-rabbitmq-consumer/SKILL.md) → `examples/`.

| Topik | Standar proyek |
|-------|----------------|
| Connection | Satu `rabbitConnection` — jangan `new KnittoRabbitMQ()` di file lain |
| Consumer | `createConsumer()` + `consumer.add('route', handler)`; **export default** |
| Layering | `*.consumer.ts` tipis; logic di `*.handler.ts`; Valibot di `*.request.ts` |
| Subscribe | `subscribe('./consumers', { pattern: '**/*.consumer.ts' })` |
| Route | Satu string per `add()`; wildcard `*` / `#` didukung |
| Error consumer | Throw agar retry/DLQ jalan — jangan catch tanpa re-throw |
| Error publisher | Log + re-throw (`publishers/*.publisher.ts`) |
| Naming | Folder/file `kebab-case`; suffix `.consumer.ts`, `.handler.ts`, `.request.ts` |

## Retry & DLQ

Quorum queue + `x-delivery-limit`; handler gagal → broker retry → limit habis → `{queue}.dlq` via `{exchangeName}.dlq`.

## Larangan proyek

- Instance RabbitMQ baru per file/handler
- Subscribe tanpa `init()`
- Business logic / SQL di `*.consumer.ts`
- Try-catch di `*.handler.ts` (lihat boilerplate)
- `process.exit` tanpa `shutdown()` pada SIGTERM/SIGINT (production — lihat README)
